{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_06_end","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_06","title":"勝肉火方","storyCode":"OR-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"9e3d9ef53b7afd7efbff349b54ef80aa7a6f388c1be2609db4eec68d193d38cc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g12_ningfucourtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那位朋友這麼快就走了？也不留人家吃個飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……她還有別的要緊事，不能久留啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從小到大，都不見你帶朋友回來，還想著可以認識一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，也算不上是朋友……"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人看著垂頭喪氣的寧茵，想說些什麼，卻終究沒有開口，只是伸手拂去了她肩頭的落葉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快要走了，還有好多事放不下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……爺爺也是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，前些日子總盼著趕快回去，真要走了，看著這一草一木，又都放不下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得嗎？當年就在這亭子裡，鋪一層沙，拾一根棍，一筆一畫地教你寫字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當時和我說，來年，府上所有的對聯都要由你來寫。我陪你練了兩個月，最後你自己撐不下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果第二年，你還真送了我一副對聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“花好月圓吃得飽，天長地久……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事，爺爺都還記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪能忘啊……又是一年中秋，日子過得真快啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們爺孫兩個是不是很久沒這樣聊過天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。最近我一直出門在外，爺爺您也忙著接待客人，見面的機會都很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次舉家離京，折騰得不輕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過回到瑯珆就清淨了，路上也有大把時間讓我們談天說地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己的那本書，終於要寫完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，我可能……不能和你一起回瑯珆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……何時做的決定？"},{"type":"narration","text":"寧茵輕輕搖頭，身子卻往後退了幾步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺此次歸鄉，是葉落歸根，人之常情，家人都非常明白。然而路途遙遠，換誰也放心不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧家人才輩出，每個人都為大炎做著舉足輕重的工作。相比下來，若要有一個人陪您回去，沒人比我更適合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過話說回來，我本就是瑯珆遠房遺孤出身，多虧爺爺憐憫，才能在這寧府住了幾十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今前往瑯珆，也算是回到父母生前故居了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時你主動要求陪我回鄉……是這麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……爺爺，我本來是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都合情合理，我幾乎都要說服自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這幾日，為了為《百灶食珍錄》結尾，我抱著告別的心思，又一次遊歷了百灶的大街小巷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可我發現自己所有的回憶，都與這座城市有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能清楚地記得，院中那棵柿樹是哪年栽下的，何時的果子最適合釀酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有街頭巷尾的各家餐館，它們的廚師各自有什麼樣的脾性，同一道菜又有多少種不同的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然發現，比起這座寧府的宅子，這座城市，才更像是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怪我，怪我沒有早些問你的想法。這陣子都是我自作主張了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，從小到大，您就是我唯一的親人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初我的確想和您回故鄉，而如今堅持留在百灶……也是因為爺爺您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最開始加入太史閣，參與編寫史書時，有件事一直讓我百思不得其解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎數千年的歷史，突然從某個節點開始，推廣文字，普及教育。一些研究用的碑文，最早也就能追溯到那個時期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，在那個時代，一定有人推動了這些變革。可我翻閱了幾乎所有資料，卻找不到一絲線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一種奇怪的感覺，大炎的史書上，彷彿缺失了一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到有次，我在一間棋館遇到了個怪人，他和我講了關於“那個人”的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原先以為他只是個故弄玄虛的說書人，可是在後續的研究中，我漸漸發現，他和我說的那些故事，居然一一被印證了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他的敘述裡，“她”是個溫柔的人，為天下蒼生，付出了太多心血……可為何這樣一個好人，卻沒辦法在史書上留下一個名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我才意識到，原來史書從來不是一個容器，而是一把篩子。能留下的故事，少之又少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺……我想要記錄下您的故事。可是我回過頭來，卻突然發現，與您相伴幾十年，我竟然都沒有辦法清晰地寫下您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寫下您，是一個什麼樣的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寧茵終於抬起頭，直視著老人的眼睛。\n她期待著老人會回答，回答她沒有說出口的疑問。\n她等了很久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1631_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有動靜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有動靜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1631_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……總覺得聽到了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1631_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是這幾天見的古怪案子太多了，總覺得不知道什麼時候就有人要跑來鬧事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是大理寺，哪個腦袋有問題的敢闖這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別自己嚇自己了，站完這班哨就趕快下班回家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待會先從正門進……就說自己是來報案的，再在去等候室的路上找到樓層的地圖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天那個等候室的窗戶朝北，大理寺正門朝南，背面是高築的圍牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯的辦公室在三樓……從窗戶翻出去，順著消防管道往上爬，不會被發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等找到那傢伙，*炎國粗口*先給她一拳……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼在這裡？我來抓你回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那身官服去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我辭官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到旅店看到你人不在，就怕你做蠢事，還真是怕什麼來什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們換個地方再說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，這麼多年以來，顧筌其實一直都停留在寧府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你是怎麼打聽到的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就別管那麼多了。你能不能直接告訴我，這到底意味著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧尚書與顧筌一案的牽扯比我想像的還要深，之前他的證言顯然有所隱瞞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我一度懷疑過他就是行兇者，可是按莫不服的證詞，如果顧筌當年為舊案伸冤而被打入死獄，而寧述是救他出來的那個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他便沒有動機再次謀害他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最關鍵的是……我之前從不知道，虞澄竟然早已與顧筌有過接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一系列事情背後的關聯，可能比我想像的還要複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是很好奇，我爸當年孤身一人來到百灶，他到底是想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是最關鍵的問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（煌對於顧筌的兩段人生一無所知……如果顧筌的確是當年案件的受牽連者，又為何要在十幾年後回到百灶，將自己置於漩渦中央？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（寧述的立場、虞澄的謀劃……這些問題還是沒有頭緒。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我又該如何讓煌知道……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你幹嘛又是一副欲言又止的表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們接下來到底該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，昨天的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我知道你們“職責在身”的人，時不時就要做點不正常的事，都懶得和你們計較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你別再說什麼為了我的安全，讓我一個人回去之類的蠢話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還打算趕我走？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，你相信我，這件事，我一定會徹查到底……只是，你不能繼續留在百灶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按我之前說的，兩天內離開百灶，先去龍門的辦事處。那裡也不是久留之地，你整頓好就立刻再啟程，儘快離開炎國——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我絕不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不相信我會繼續追查下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是信你，可你自己一個人沒有官銜，沒有身分，還怎麼查案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄可以辭官暗中調查，我也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不如做得徹底一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你想怎麼做？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌從口袋中掏出了一封信。\n那是莫不服給她的機會，現在成了她們兩人的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反正我們東奔西跑也問不出個結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們去百珍宴，直接找真龍問個清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g5_dragonpalace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下，這是禮部擬好的百珍宴與會官員的名單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時值佳節，維多利亞、萊塔尼亞、拉特蘭等國也遣使節送來賀帖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請陛下過目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……咳咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下……兵部協同司歲台已經擬定了完整的作戰計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還請陛下……咳咳……過目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作戰耗費的人力財力、戰後恢復諸事，都沒有與戶部商議過，這作戰計劃是如何擬定的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道太傅大人和戶部繁忙，兵部就多操了一點心，打這一仗要用的人力錢糧，乃至工部戰後修復的花銷，這筆帳我們都算清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，當著陛下的面，太傅大人一起看了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錢糧物資能算，戰事一起，大炎子民要流多少血，這也是一筆能算清的帳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那太傅的意思是，算不清，就不用算了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"秋天了……今年北方的收成怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場災害過後，大荒城已經儘快恢復了生產。今年的收成，和以往數年相差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那……明年呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生年不滿百，常懷千歲憂……可時間不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事繫大炎萬民生計，請陛下三思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅大人，該議的事，內閣六部，早都不知道議了多少遍，總該到了拿主意的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1239_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下聖意已決，百珍宴上，等陛下宣布即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天色晚了，眼看要下雨的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帷幕後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……二位請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅&太尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"臣告退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"帷幕後的人抬眼望去——\n空蕩蕩的宮殿，高位之側，三張坐席並列擺設，居中的那張已經陳舊。\n一聲幽微的嘆息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲哎喲……這雨怎麼說下就下，淋得我一身……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場秋雨一場寒……再過幾天都吃不上新鮮蔬菜囉。今年冬天的衣服都還沒來得及準備啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大廚，今年的冬菜說什麼也得提前開始準備了，你趁早把倉庫裡你那些亂七八糟的東西——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大廚……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐？行箸姑娘？人呢……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g13_yuskitchen"},{"type":"narration","text":"平常熱鬧的廚房此時空無一人，廚具也被歸置整齊，局促的空間看起來竟寬敞了不少。\n只有灶火上燉著一鍋湯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
